WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:07.839
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:09.170
You are not Cthulhu!

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.980
Dr. Bright is not allowed to claim that he
is an ancient Eldritch being.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:16.820
Nor is he allowed to declare "After ten thousand
years I'm free!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.610
It's time to conquer Earth!"

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.500
whenever he takes on a new host.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:27.419
Also, SCP-2662 has caught wind of this whole
charade, and it's making him very uncomfortable.

00:00:27.419 --> 00:00:29.769
He politely requests that it stop.

00:00:29.769 --> 00:00:31.779
Identity theft is no joke.

